        "PMC4145285::chunk::002::discussion::f8c841f9e4"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Uniform grain refinement or dislocation engineering exemplifies processing that increases strength at the cost of ductility.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Atomistic and mesoscale simulations using tunable interatomic potentials can design the proposed heterogeneous alloy microstructure.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The computational method can predict and help induce coherent nanoprecipitates or phase alternations.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A heterogeneous microstructure with alternating phases can combine high strength and high ductility.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::chunk::002::discussion::f8c841f9e4",
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The alternating phases act respectively as soft, ductile regions and hard, strength-enhancing regions.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fine lamellar FCC/B2 structures can provide balanced high fracture strength and high ductility.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::chunk::002::discussion::f8c841f9e4"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent nanoprecipitate interfaces facilitate dislocation transmission.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Coherent nanoprecipitate interfaces relieve local stress concentrations associated with premature crack initiation.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10213035::chunk::000::abstract::2906c9eda2"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Facilitated dislocation transmission and reduced stress concentration can decouple strengthening from ductility loss.",
